        // ---- Walls and gates ----
        // Each tier upgrades in place to the next: palisade -> stone -> reinforced -> force.
        // A faction that lists a tier must also list every tier it upgrades into.
        // Upgrades keep the footprint: walls 3.0 x 1.0, gates 9.0 x 1.2 in every tier.
        // At least 1.0 m thick so the 1 m nav grid sees a closed line. Gates are 9 m long
        // (three wall segments) so anything up to 5 m wide (giants included, k = 2) passes
        // at any angle: A* clears an axis-aligned 5 x 5 block, which a diagonal 6-7.5 m
        // gate never opens (af_data tests/geometry.rs).
